8 GB GPU)\n\n**Models** (put in `ComfyUI/models/...`):\n- `diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` — [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n- `text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` — same repo\n- `vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`, `vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` — same repo\n- `loras/dmad_minimax_h3_4step_full_critic_comfyui.safetensors` — [ZhengmingYu/DMAD](https://huggingface.co/ZhengmingYu/DMAD/tree/main/minimax_h3)\n\n**Settings that matter:** LoRA strength 1.0 · shift 12 / audio 2 · sampler `lcm` + scheduler `simple` · no CFG.\n**Steps:** 4 = fastest; 8 or 12 give finer detail on fast motion. Avoid `euler` (softer).\n**Prompt:** describe the shot, then `overall_soundscape:` and `non_diegetic_music:` for the audio.\n**8 GB GPUs:** 124 frames = 5 s at 24 fps. The `H3 Memory Optimization` node (Lower VRAM attention, 1024-row\nchunks) and the `H3 AIMDO Residency Limiter` (0 blocks) of [H3-Optimizations](https://github.com/Zironic/H3-Optimizations)\n(install with ComfyUI-Manager) make it fit in 8 GB (it runs with 6 GB free); the model streams from system memory (64 GB RAM\nrecommended).\nFor 15 s use the 4- or 8-step 15 s workflows on a 16 GB GPU or larger.\n"}}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# Minimax H3 提示词设计工具（支持图片/音视频解析理解）：  \n# https://app-16e1ad4d40f74cdab2150729a9fe4bb0.apps.vibex.cn/?inviteCode=qdaveyiq"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [431.929951704579, 318.8597618630456], "pos": [-501.1025114274662, 4.499033947616117], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "# Minimax H3 提示词设计工具（支持图片/音视频解析理解）：  \n# https://app-16e1ad4d40f74cdab2150729a9fe4bb0.apps.vibex.cn/?inviteCode=qdaveyiq"}}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [25], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_va